1
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:03,453
Meet BSWA.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,927
The digital home of the Brahmanbaria Students'
Welfare Association at Jagannath University.

3
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:15,913
A public website for the community, and an admin
panel for the committee behind it.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:22,470
Visitors explore the district's heritage, its
nine upazilas, and an interactive map.

5
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,735
Students and alumni are searchable by batch,

6
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:29,261
department and upazila, with private details
kept private.

7
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:34,269
The committee, a photo gallery and common
questions, in Bangla or English.

8
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,316
Behind the scenes, the admin panel shows the
whole community at a glance.

9
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:41,481
Every sign-up is reviewed.

10
00:00:41,521 --> 00:00:46,253
Directory records are verified, and an
invitation activates a member's account.

11
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:51,267
One setting decides which batches count as
alumni, and every page follows it.

12
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:56,367
Heritage places, the gallery, events and FAQ are
managed in one place,

13
00:00:56,407 --> 00:00:58,255
with a full activity history.

14
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:02,068
Publish in the panel, and it is live on the
site.

15
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:08,422
Built end to end with React and Vite, a Go API,

16
00:01:08,462 --> 00:01:14,717
and Supabase for PostgreSQL and authentication,
with row level security on private data.

17
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:18,989
BSWA.

18
00:01:19,029 --> 00:01:20,964
Explore the project on GitHub.

